    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάπῠρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>red-hot,</i> Anaxag.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				1
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				631
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				954a18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίδηρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					346b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάπυρα, τά,</span>
			<i>embers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				58c
			</span></i>; <i>extremely hot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτραι δ. ὑπὸ τοῦ ἡλίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inflamed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>ardent, fiery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				615e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				783a
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πρὸς ὀργήν, πρὸς δόξαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.577a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Luc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐραστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μῖσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>
			<i>ardently,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέχειν σχολῇ εὐσεβείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					89a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρασθῆναί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>using fire,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					10.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
